                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="77" value="Benefits:&lt;div&gt;- Better modularity/flexibility in including features&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Nicer on my head when thinking about how to incorporate new features&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- &#39;Feels better&#39; than one large ~700 line .comp file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Can get more precise measurements on timings for passes (more video content)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="62" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="43" y="155" width="219" height="281" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="78" value="Not Benefits:&lt;div&gt;- Thinning the swap, this will be big&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Debugging could become harder - more to look through&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Potential performance hits?&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="62" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="314" y="155" width="219" height="102" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="79" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;entryX=0.041;entryY=0.725;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" parent="62" target="78" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <mxPoint x="254" y="297" as="sourcePoint"/>
                        <mxPoint x="312" y="254" as="targetPoint"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="125" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;rounded=0;curved=0;" parent="62" source="80" target="124" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="558" y="223"/>
                            <mxPoint x="558" y="338"/>
                            <mxPoint x="16" y="336"/>
                            <mxPoint x="20" y="841"/>
                        </Array>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="80" value="How will I pass data between shaders?&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Could bind textures, able to send a vec4 per pixel per texture to each new pass&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;What kind of data needed to pass?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Raycast results (Position, Normal, TriInx, MatIdx)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Triangle information&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Material information&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Pass &lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(102, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;information&lt;/font&gt; or &lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 51, 51));&quot;&gt;idx&lt;/font&gt;?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;- Have to pass materials into intersection ; &#39;feels wrong&#39;, intersection is for intersection, not calculating uv coordinates&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(102, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;- Other passes have a nicer time ; will be handling raw data&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(102, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;- Limits passing structs around (And copying definitions...)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(102, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;- Probably faster working in images&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Final image (Post-processing)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="62" vertex="1">
